{
  "bookId": "hero-214019",
  "id": "bond-35314",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35314001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "无聊的话，要找点有意思的事情一起做吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "啊，我知道，逛街，看电影，一起吃饭……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "咯咯咯，这些老土的约会真是好有意思呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不喜欢吗，还是克拉拉已经厌倦我了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "啧，太土了太土了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看来彻底被嫌弃了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "要一起出门的话快点去换上我挑的衣服。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哎，可是刚才不是还说约会很土吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "喂喂喂，带好口罩，别被粉丝认出来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好。有点苦恼，跟不上克拉拉心情变化的速度呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "你烦恼的样子真是超级可爱！来，茄子——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "35314013",
              "text": "茄子！"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "35314013",
              "text": "诶？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "35314012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35314013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克拉拉",
          "text": "又和你度过了一个无聊重复的一天，真高兴，咯咯咯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
